  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Installing open-source tools for FPGA development",
      "source_hash": 7743843560989972376,
      "context_hash": 6830954698463692933,
      "translation": "FPGA 개발을 위한 오픈소스 도구 설치하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768835Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Latest news (April 2023): pre-built toolchain for Ice40 and ECP5-based FPGAs can be downloaded from [here](https://github.com/YosysHQ/oss-cad-suite-build/releases) (Windows/Mac/Linux).",
      "source_hash": 18443701070173097807,
      "context_hash": 16302813865335572949,
      "translation": "최신 소식 (2023년 4월): Ice40 및 ECP5 기반 FPGA를 위한 사전 빌드된 툴체인을 [여기](https://github.com/YosysHQ/oss-cad-suite-build/releases)에서 다운로드할 수 있습니다 (Windows/Mac/Linux).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Just download the package, and set the path using `source ~/where/you/unpacked/it/oss-cad-suite/environment` everytime you want to use it (thanks @mecrisp for pointing at that).",
      "source_hash": 96723280351502985,
      "context_hash": 11225395691874553614,
      "translation": "패키지를 다운로드한 후, 사용할 때마다 `source ~/where/you/unpacked/it/oss-cad-suite/environment`로 경로를 설정하십시오 (이를 알려준 @mecrisp에게 감사드립니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "What follows is for folks who want to compile the tools on their own, or if you have something else than an Ice40 or ECP5 (for instance, an ARTY).",
      "source_hash": 16169210856503369053,
      "context_hash": 7644260419200096288,
      "translation": "이어지는 내용은 도구를 직접 컴파일하고자 하는 분들, 또는 Ice40이나 ECP5가 아닌 다른 것(예를 들어 ARTY)을 가지고 계신 분들을 위한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "_Note: the following instructions are for Linux (I'm using Ubuntu).",
      "source_hash": 1921109834272535115,
      "context_hash": 15515791503069395395,
      "translation": "*참고: 다음 지침은 Linux용입니다 (저는 Ubuntu를 사용하고 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Windows users can run the tutorial using WSL.",
      "source_hash": 7583218878501044541,
      "context_hash": 3200070682955771910,
      "translation": "Windows 사용자는 WSL을 사용하여 튜토리얼을 실행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "It requires some adaptation, as explained [here](WSL.md)._",
      "source_hash": 12317032599082648804,
      "context_hash": 4499172283292364931,
      "translation": "[여기](WSL.md)에 설명된 대로 약간의 조정이 필요합니다.*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Before starting, you will need to install the OpenSource FPGA development tools.",
      "source_hash": 6919069384416834296,
      "context_hash": 18205420417538544749,
      "translation": "시작하기 전에 OpenSource FPGA 개발 도구를 설치해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "You will need the following components:",
      "source_hash": 8373489293394162293,
      "context_hash": 8751080138338723334,
      "translation": "다음 구성 요소들이 필요합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Verilog compilation and synthesis: Yosys",
      "source_hash": 12020210781922466770,
      "context_hash": 15081448576629971025,
      "translation": "Verilog 컴파일 및 합성: Yosys",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Verilog": "Verilog"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Debugging tools: icarus/iverilog and verilator",
      "source_hash": 1394598061354161302,
      "context_hash": 6711132147236839847,
      "translation": "디버깅 도구: icarus/iverilog 및 verilator",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "FPGA support libraries: IceStorm (Ice40) or Trellis (ECP5)",
      "source_hash": 8868026402368864400,
      "context_hash": 18412875482142487906,
      "translation": "FPGA 지원 라이브러리: IceStorm (Ice40) 또는 Trellis (ECP5)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Place and root: NextPNR",
      "source_hash": 5971777397242745561,
      "context_hash": 3012768853909839520,
      "translation": "배치 및 배선: NextPNR",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Tool to send bitstream to FPGA: ujprog",
      "source_hash": 12456275623760408931,
      "context_hash": 817666235325897610,
      "translation": "비트스트림을 FPGA로 전송하는 도구: ujprog",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Although there exists some precompiled packages, I highly recommend to get fresh source versions from the source repositories, because the tools quickly evolve and get better and better !",
      "source_hash": 4840161609447228757,
      "context_hash": 7971783427378775727,
      "translation": "사전 컴파일된 패키지들이 존재하기는 하지만, 도구들이 빠르게 발전하고 계속 더 좋아지고 있기 때문에 소스 저장소에서 최신 소스 버전을 받으실 것을 적극 권장합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "What follows is a set of instructions to get and install the latest versions of the tools.",
      "source_hash": 12218394420409306091,
      "context_hash": 9443511950465364181,
      "translation": "이어지는 내용은 도구들의 최신 버전을 받아 설치하기 위한 일련의 지침입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:35.768838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
