    {
      "id": "section:13/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 5: Tool to send bitstream to FPGA",
      "source_hash": 4288090916087190469,
      "context_hash": 10860052504552948279,
      "translation": "5단계: 비트스트림을 FPGA로 전송하는 도구",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We need to let normal users program the IceStick through USB.",
      "source_hash": 15888452802428542187,
      "context_hash": 12747183058663755564,
      "translation": "일반 사용자가 USB를 통해 IceStick을 프로그래밍할 수 있도록 해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This can be done by creating a file in `/etc/udev/rules.d`.",
      "source_hash": 11563269711098453015,
      "context_hash": 17549346248019603549,
      "translation": "이는 `/etc/udev/rules.d`에 파일을 생성하여 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Instructions are different for different FPGAs.",
      "source_hash": 14667970120298507788,
      "context_hash": 6802883577264314442,
      "translation": "안내는 FPGA마다 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Then you need a tool to flash the FPGA (see instructions below to install it).",
      "source_hash": 14984382057349997591,
      "context_hash": 6541896513674830438,
      "translation": "그런 다음 FPGA에 플래시할 도구가 필요합니다(설치 안내는 아래 참조).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "Note: openFPGALoader is a quickly evolving tool that seems to support most of the FPGAs (TODO: update this tutorial and instructions with systematic use of openFPGALoader, seems to be the way to go...).",
      "source_hash": 7460016743847534143,
      "context_hash": 4679628521280691241,
      "translation": "참고: openFPGALoader는 빠르게 발전하는 도구로, 대부분의 FPGA를 지원하는 것으로 보입니다(TODO: openFPGALoader를 체계적으로 사용하도록 이 튜토리얼과 안내를 업데이트할 것, 이 방향이 맞는 것으로 보임...).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Ice40 FPGAs (iceprog)",
      "source_hash": 1886372019537050305,
      "context_hash": 7429417193683216853,
      "translation": "Ice40 FPGA (iceprog)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Create in `/etc/udev/rules.d` a file `53-lattice-ftdi.rules` with the following content:",
      "source_hash": 5069540906812565755,
      "context_hash": 636248961032033206,
      "translation": "`/etc/udev/rules.d`에 다음 내용으로 `53-lattice-ftdi.rules` 파일을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "_(no additional tool to install, `iceprog` is included in `icestorm` that we installed in step 3)_",
      "source_hash": 15348033469791300237,
      "context_hash": 17786918473076089337,
      "translation": "*(추가로 설치할 도구는 없습니다. `iceprog`는 3단계에서 설치한 `icestorm`에 포함되어 있습니다)*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "OrangeCrab (ECP5)",
      "source_hash": 331268827651594214,
      "context_hash": 3807057186679009021,
      "translation": "OrangeCrab (ECP5)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Create in `/etc/udev/rules.d` a file `99-orangecrab.rules` with the following content:",
      "source_hash": 10427010853527205338,
      "context_hash": 15868873547944942847,
      "translation": "`/etc/udev/rules.d`에 다음 내용으로 `99-orangecrab.rules` 파일을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "OrangeCrab works in DFU mode, needs dfu-util (like FOMU below).",
      "source_hash": 13902747898999756835,
      "context_hash": 6658207050099436915,
      "translation": "OrangeCrab는 DFU 모드로 동작하며, (아래의 FOMU처럼) dfu-util이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Note: when you program the OrangeCrab, keep its button pushed when plugging it in to enter DFU mode.",
      "source_hash": 16701568857572299709,
      "context_hash": 82198721418906192,
      "translation": "참고: OrangeCrab를 프로그래밍할 때는 DFU 모드로 진입하기 위해 연결하는 동안 버튼을 누른 상태로 유지하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FOMU",
      "source_hash": 15265587053030901076,
      "context_hash": 9983079185882064933,
      "translation": "FOMU",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "FOMU includes a Ice40up5k FPGA (Ice40 family) but requires different USB rules and tools:",
      "source_hash": 14140838546171425943,
      "context_hash": 8726425953979239656,
      "translation": "FOMU에는 Ice40up5k FPGA(Ice40 계열)가 포함되어 있지만, 다른 USB 규칙과 도구가 필요합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375640Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Create in `/etc/udev/rules.d` a file `99-fomu.rules` with the following content:",
      "source_hash": 3279036324109402726,
      "context_hash": 11892299357709050569,
      "translation": "`/etc/udev/rules.d`에 다음 내용으로 `99-fomu.rules` 파일을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Install dfu-util (FOMU/OrangeCrab):",
      "source_hash": 8128500101462711065,
      "context_hash": 13460968225613059723,
      "translation": "dfu-util을 설치합니다(FOMU/OrangeCrab용):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Plug the FOMU or the OrangeCrab (with its button pushed) and test it:",
      "source_hash": 13628495500280097812,
      "context_hash": 16482192081182061782,
      "translation": "FOMU 또는 (버튼을 누른 상태의) OrangeCrab를 연결하고 테스트합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "It should display something like:",
      "source_hash": 7458675500101879158,
      "context_hash": 2024545935781431820,
      "translation": "다음과 같은 내용이 표시되어야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ECP5 FPGAs",
      "source_hash": 1307654049698910469,
      "context_hash": 9155133905165948877,
      "translation": "ECP5 FPGA",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:39.375641Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating in `/etc/udev/rules.d` a file `80-fpga-ulx3s.rules` with the following content:",
      "source_hash": 12105876195041275827,
      "context_hash": 106654632897725805,
      "translation": "`/etc/udev/rules.d`에 다음 내용으로 `80-fpga-ulx3s.rules` 파일을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549024Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Now install `ujprog` (the tool to send the bitstream to the FPGA):",
      "source_hash": 4468121573428421620,
      "context_hash": 10036113919875219290,
      "translation": "이제 `ujprog`(비트스트림을 FPGA로 전송하는 도구)를 설치합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "All FPGAs",
      "source_hash": 9081545554566287020,
      "context_hash": 5879833565082100514,
      "translation": "모든 FPGA",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [OpenFPGALoader](https://github.com/trabucayre/openFPGALoader) supports many FPGAs and is easy to use.",
      "source_hash": 15121253380198601504,
      "context_hash": 1859278269617064748,
      "translation": "[OpenFPGALoader](https://github.com/trabucayre/openFPGALoader)는 다양한 FPGA를 지원하며 사용하기 쉽습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "To install it, follow [the documentation](https://github.com/trabucayre/openFPGALoader#compile-and-install), or (TL;DR):",
      "source_hash": 11996335710226315529,
      "context_hash": 16128294010225680181,
      "translation": "설치하려면 [문서](https://github.com/trabucayre/openFPGALoader#compile-and-install)를 따르거나, (요약하자면):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "To see the list of supported boards:",
      "source_hash": 1181090633555416261,
      "context_hash": 8821263367155041928,
      "translation": "지원되는 보드 목록을 보려면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "To send bitstream to SRAM (program temporarily)",
      "source_hash": 399491832102691523,
      "context_hash": 3526630128439407883,
      "translation": "비트스트림을 SRAM으로 전송하기(임시로 프로그래밍)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "To send bitstream to FLASH (program permanently)",
      "source_hash": 9135078920414784595,
      "context_hash": 1297592426768483740,
      "translation": "비트스트림을 FLASH로 전송하기(영구적으로 프로그래밍)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Wow, super simple !",
      "source_hash": 18186730946466028862,
      "context_hash": 10386744592414963042,
      "translation": "와, 정말 간단합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "Love it !",
      "source_hash": 15223040945760777842,
      "context_hash": 4609505863143652501,
      "translation": "마음에 듭니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:56:31.549027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:19/block:0/seg:0",
